WEBVTT

00:07:26.775 --> 00:07:30.779
"Now, oh, now I've been invited
to the big table.

00:07:31.238 --> 00:07:33.449
And now things will be different."

00:07:33.491 --> 00:07:35.826
So I took my seat.

00:07:37.119 --> 00:07:38.496
Now, unfortunately,

00:07:38.537 --> 00:07:42.082
the budget wasn't based
on the importance or significance

00:07:42.124 --> 00:07:44.084
or historic nature of the show.

00:07:44.084 --> 00:07:47.171
It was based on the 1:30am
time-slot that we had.

00:07:47.171 --> 00:07:49.798
So to say the budget was small,

00:07:49.798 --> 00:07:51.967
the writing staff even smaller,

00:07:51.967 --> 00:07:53.302
and to do the first season,

00:07:53.302 --> 00:07:58.182
I had to shoot 96 episodes
of late-night television in three months.

00:07:58.224 --> 00:07:59.350
Audience: Whoo.

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.268
LS: Whoo is right.